  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第七关（后）\nTime - Unknown \\ Weather - Unknown \\ Visibility - Poor\nChernobog - Operation Squad E0's Location\nDr. {@nickname} Rescue Operation, Phase 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Ah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "This clinic..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "Amiya, haven't we been here before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "You're right..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "But why has it... become like this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Medic",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "text": "It's been totally abandoned... It looks it was attacked by Reunion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Wasn't this Azazel, the clinic for the Infected?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Yes..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Even though they had access to Chernobog's entire underground intelligence network, they still refused to work with us..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Back then, it wasn't clear what kind of dealings that had with Reunion..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "If only they had given us some information, or even just a hint..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "We could've been out of here by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "They brought this outcome upon themselves!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "That's not the entire story..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Amiya, you were there for the negotiations, weren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "That cold and arrogant attitude of theirs really ticked me off..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "We can't blame them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Guard",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "text": "Boss..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "It's hard for the Infected to trust anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "speakerId": "char_014_riope",
      "text": "After enduring so many hardships, who can blame them for becoming jaded and stubborn?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I can understand why they did what they did... and I can forgive them. Those who don't protect themselves are easily hurt by others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Moreover, the Infected often can't even trust each other. Not everyone is able to stomach the kinds of risks that we take either..."
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "A clinic for the Infected?",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Azazel... They were a black-market clinic that only provided services to the Infected."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Given the social status of the Infected, they couldn't openly reveal themselves in public."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Some of the Infected, not wanting to be thrown into quarantine, are hiding throughout the city, just trying to survive."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Azazel was aimed at providing services to these people."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "...They must have rejected Reunion's proposals."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, I previously mentioned that we're all sick, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "This disease will claim our lives, but it also grants us with extraordinary powers."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "For example, I can use Originium Arts without the aid of a staff."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "However, this disease does not only destroy our bodies..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "It also destroys any chance we have at living a normal life. Or rather, 'civilized society' strips everything away from us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Chernobog has been the shining beacon of this 'civility.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Fearing, hating, exiling, and purging the Infected..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Nearl",
          "speakerId": "char_148_nearl",
          "text": "And, this is how it ends."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "The only thing is, how many Infected were even given the option to choose between us, Reunion, or some other organization?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Most of them simply lost everything."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Perhaps, this clinic was a warm place that some of them could call home..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "There is no cure for Oripathy. At least right now, the Infected can only die in despair."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "And their bodies... become new sources of infection."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "With their abnormal powers and fatally infectious disease..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "The Infected... are the most hated people on this planet."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Doctor, you probably won't be able to understand everything just based upon my brief explanation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "But when you see the consequences of these problems with your own eyes... you will understand."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "You'll see the harsh reality surrounding the Infected."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "Rhodes Island emphasizes equality for all, whereas Reunion is fanatically Infected-centric. However, organizations like ours are a rare sight."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "I can understand why you're angry, but it's hard not to sympathize with this little clinic."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "...I see."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "Perhaps they really ended up facing a bigger crisis than they could handle..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dobermann",
          "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
          "text": "In any case, we should leave our anger behind, along with this clinic."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Rhodes Island is filled with good people. Though fear and hostility might create rifts between people..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "I believe that all misunderstandings will be resolved, as long as we're a part of the same family."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Perhaps... Rhodes Island is but another Azazel?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Guard",
          "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
          "text": "Amiya..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Amiya",
          "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "Let's go, Doctor."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
